    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306D\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u3082\u306E\u306F\u672C\u4EBA\u306B\u805E\u304B\u306A\u3044\u3068\n\u4F55\u3092\u6368\u3066\u3061\u3083\u3044\u3051\u306A\u3044\u304B\u5206\u304B\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3057\n\u305D\u3046\u3057\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, and we should leave Resna\u0027s things alone since we don\u0027t know what she wants to keep."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3055\u30FC\u3066\u3001\u3042\u305F\u3057\u304C\u6574\u7406\u3067\u304D\u305D\u3046\u306A\u3082\u306E\u306F\n\u3069\u3053\u304B\u306B\u3042\u308B\u304B\u3057\u3089\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, let\u0027s see what I can sort through..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u66F8\u304D\u640D\u3058\u306E\u30EC\u30B7\u30D4\u306E\u7D19",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Some unfinished recipe notes"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3093\uFF5E\u3001\u3053\u308C\u3063\u3066\u4F55\u304B\u306E\u8A18\u9332\u304B\u3057\u3089\uFF1F\n\u3067\u3082\u3001\u9014\u4E2D\u3067\u66F8\u304F\u3053\u3068\u3092\u9593\u9055\u3048\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\n\u305D\u306E\u307E\u307E\u7F6E\u3044\u3066\u304A\u3044\u305F\u3082\u306E\u307F\u305F\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, are these records of some kind? Looks like someone made a mistake while writing and just left it here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8AB0\u3067\u3082\u9593\u9055\u3048\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3042\u308B\u308F\u3002\n\u66F8\u3044\u3066\u308B\u3060\u3051\u5049\u3044\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone makes mistakes. At least they tried to keep records."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306F\u3001\n\u3088\u304F\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u8A18\u9332\u3059\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you often keep records like this, Saskia?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305F\u307E\u306B\u306F\u306D\u3002\u3053\u306E\u524D\u601D\u3044\u3064\u3044\u305F\n\u30EC\u30B7\u30D4\u3060\u3063\u3066\u3001\u307B\u3089\u3053\u3053\u306B\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sometimes. Actually, I wrote down a recipe the other day, right here..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3042\u3089\u3001\u3069\u3053\u306B\u3084\u3063\u305F\u304B\u3057\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Oh my, where did I put it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u66F8\u3044\u3066\u3082\u3001\u305D\u306E\u66F8\u3044\u305F\u7D19\u3092\u3069\u3053\u306B\u3084\u3063\u305F\u304B\n\u5FD8\u308C\u3061\u3083\u3046\u4EBA\u3067\u3059\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you\u0027re the type who writes things down but forgets where you put them..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5931\u6557\u3057\u305F\u8ABF\u5408\u54C1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Failed synthesis items"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u306F\u2026\u2026\u306A\u3093\u3060\u308D\u3046\u3002\u71C3\u3048\u304B\u3059\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What\u0027s this... ashes?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3001\u305D\u3053\u306B\u7F6E\u3044\u3066\u3042\u308B\u306E\u306F\u5931\u6557\u3057\u305F\n\u8ABF\u5408\u54C1\u3060\u304B\u3089\u6368\u3066\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3044\u308F\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, those are failed syntheses. We can throw them away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3001\u3067\u3082\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3046\u71C3\u3048\u304B\u3059\u3067\u3082\n\u7D20\u6750\u3068\u3057\u3066\u4F7F\u3048\u308B\u3068\u304D\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But sometimes even burnt materials can be useful as ingredients!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u3089\u307E\u305F\u4F5C\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u308F\u3002\n\u8ABF\u5408\u306B\u5931\u6557\u3059\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u3060\u3051\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we need them, we can always make more. Just have to fail at synthesis again."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308B\u7A0B\u5EA6\u8155\u304C\u7ACB\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308B\u3068\u3001\n\u5931\u6557\u3059\u308B\u306E\u304C\u96E3\u3057\u304F\u306A\u3063\u305F\u308A\u3082\n\u3059\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3051\u3069\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Once you get good enough, it actually becomes hard to fail on purpose..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306F\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3051\u308C\u3069\u3001\n\u91CF\u304C\u591A\u3059\u304E\u308B\u3068\u7BA1\u7406\u304C\u5FC5\u8981\u306D\u3047\u3002\n\u3053\u308C\u306E\u305B\u3044\u3067\u30A2\u30C8\u30EA\u30A8\u304C\u7126\u3052\u81ED\u3044\u6C17\u304C\u3059\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s true, but having too many makes storage difficult. Plus, I think these are making the atelier smell burnt."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304F\u3093\u304F\u3093\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u3042\u3001\u305F\u3057\u304B\u306B\u306A\u3093\u304B\u9999\u3070\u3057\u3044\u5302\u3044\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sniff sniff*... Ah, there is a kind of toasty smell..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u670D\u306B\u3064\u304F\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u308F\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It might get on your clothes, you know?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3047\u3063\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ehhh?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5927\u4E8B\u305D\u3046\u306A\u66F8\u985E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Important-looking documents"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u306F\u2026\u2026\u66F8\u985E\uFF1F\u3000\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u91CD\u8981\u305D\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These are... documents? They look important..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3001\u305A\u3063\u3068\u524D\u306B\u56FD\u304B\u3089\u6765\u305F\u66F8\u985E\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, those are some old documents from the government."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3046\u5C4A\u3044\u3066\u304B\u3089\u968F\u5206\u7D4C\u3064\u3057\u3001\n\u3088\u304F\u5206\u304B\u3089\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3089\u3044\u3089\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3057\u3089\u3002\n\u6368\u3066\u3061\u3083\u3044\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They\u0027re quite old now, and I don\u0027t really understand them. Maybe we should just throw them away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307B\u3001\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u6368\u3066\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A-are you sure that\u0027s okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3075\u3001\u3082\u3057\u3082\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u5927\u4E8B\u306A\u624B\u7D19\u3068\u304B\u306A\u3089\n\u307E\u305F\u50AC\u4FC3\u72B6\u307F\u305F\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E\u304C\u5C4A\u304F\u3067\u3057\u3087",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehe, if they\u0027re really important, they\u0027ll send another notice."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u3066\u5927\u80C6\u306A\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s so bold...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3055\u3066\u3068\u2026\u2026\u3053\u3063\u3061\u306F\u5927\u4F53\u7247\u4ED8\u3044\u305F\u3057\u3001\n\u4ECA\u5EA6\u306F\u79C1\u306E\u3082\u306E\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... this area\u0027s mostly done, so let\u0027s look through my things..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3053\u308C\u306F\u5FC5\u8981\u3060\u3057\u2026\u2026\n\u3053\u308C\u3082\u3044\u3064\u304B\u4F7F\u3046\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3002\n\u3046\u30FC\u3093\u3001\u6368\u3066\u308B\u3082\u306E\u304C\u306A\u3044\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I need this... and I might use this someday too. Hmm, I can\u0027t find anything to throw away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u601D\u3044\u304D\u308A\u3088\u304F\u6368\u3066\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let\u0027s be decisive and throw things out!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u601D\u3044\u304D\u3063\u3066\u6368\u3066\u3061\u3083\u3044\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01\n\u305A\u3063\u3068\u3057\u307E\u3063\u3066\u3042\u308B\u3060\u3051\u3067\n\u3069\u3046\u305B\u4F7F\u308F\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let\u0027s just throw them out! If they\u0027ve just been sitting here, you probably won\u0027t use them anyway!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3063\u3066\u3001\u3042\u305F\u3057\u3082\u6368\u3066\u3089\u308C\u305A\u306B\u3044\u305F\u3068\u304D\u306B\n\u5148\u751F\u306B\u3088\u304F\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...That\u0027s what my teacher used to tell me when I couldn\u0027t let go of things."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u2026\u2026\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u5148\u751F\u306F\u304D\u3063\u3071\u308A\n\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u306D\u3002\n\u79C1\u306F\u3069\u3046\u3082\u6368\u3066\u3089\u308C\u306A\u3044\u306E\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My... your teacher was quite decisive. I just can\u0027t seem to throw things away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3067\u3082\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u8FF7\u3044\u3063\u3066\n\u3042\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059\u306D\uFF5E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So even you have trouble with things like this, Saskia~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3075\u3063\u3001\u79C1\u306B\u3060\u3063\u3066\u4EBA\u4E26\u307F\u306B\n\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u611F\u60C5\u306F\u3042\u308B\u308F\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehe, I have normal human emotions too, you know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3063\u305F\u3044\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s such a waste, isn\u0027t it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3063\u305F\u3044\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088\u306D\u3002\n\u5206\u304B\u308B\u306A\u3042\u3001\u3042\u305F\u3057\u3082\u3082\u306E\u3092\u6368\u3066\u3089\u308C\u306A\u304F\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s such a waste, right? I understand, I have trouble throwing things away too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3064\u304B\u4F7F\u3046\u304B\u3082\u3063\u3066\u601D\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3046\u306E\u3088\u306D\u3002\n\u58CA\u308C\u305F\u3082\u306E\u3060\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3001\u611B\u7740\u304C\u6E67\u3044\u305F\u308A\n\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You always think you might use it someday. Even broken things, you get attached to them..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u5F62\u3068\u3057\u3066\u6B8B\u3063\u3066\u3044\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3001\n\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3044\u3064\u304B\u5FD8\u308C\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3046\n\u6C17\u304C\u3059\u308B\u306E\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If they\u0027re not here physically, I feel like I might forget I ever had them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5206\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u4ED6\u306E\u4EBA\u306B\u5206\u304B\u3089\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3082\u3001\n\u6368\u3066\u3089\u308C\u306A\u3044\u7406\u7531\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3088\u306D\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know what you mean. Even if others don\u0027t understand, we have our reasons for keeping things~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3084\u3063\u3066\u3082\u306E\u306F\u6EA2\u308C\u3066\u3044\u304F\u306E\u3060\u3051\u3069",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though this is how things pile up..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u73FE\u5B9F\u306F\u4E16\u77E5\u8F9B\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Reality is harsh!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u308C\u3082\u5927\u4E8B\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They\u0027re all important things, aren\u0027t they?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307F\u3093\u306A\u5927\u4E8B\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everything here is important, isn\u0027t it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u3069\u3093\u306A\u306B\u3055\u3055\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3060\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u79C1\u3068\u3044\u3046\u4EBA\u9593\u3092\u5F62\u4F5C\u3063\u3066\u304D\u305F\u8981\u7D20\u3060\u3082\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Even the smallest thing has played a part in making me who I am."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305F\u3068\u3048\u305D\u308C\u304C\u4E00\u672C\u306E\u7CF8\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u306D\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u3092\u3057\u307E\u3046\u306B\u81F3\u3063\u305F\u7269\u8A9E\u304C\u3042\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even if it\u0027s just a single thread. There\u0027s a story behind why I kept it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3089\u3053\u306E\u76AE\u61D0\u304B\u3057\u3044\u308F\u3002\n\u3053\u308C\u306F\uFF13\u5E74\u524D\u306B\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, this leather brings back memories. Three years ago..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u305D\u308C\u3092\u3084\u308B\u3068\u3001\n\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u6574\u7406\u304C\u7D42\u308F\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia! If you start that, we\u0027ll never finish organizing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3055\u3066\u3001\u3044\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3082\u306E\u306E\u5206\u5225\u306F\n\u3053\u3093\u306A\u3068\u3053\u308D\u304B\u3057\u3089\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I think we\u0027ve sorted through the unnecessary items."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\n\u3058\u3083\u3042\u30A2\u30C8\u30EA\u30A8\u306E\u304A\u6383\u9664\u306F\u4ED6\u306E\u4EBA\u306B\u4EFB\u305B\u3066\n\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306F\u3053\u306E\u3054\u307F\u3092\u6368\u3066\u306B\u884C\u304D\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like it. Let\u0027s leave the atelier cleaning to someone else and take this trash out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3057\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\u3002\n\u60AA\u3044\u3051\u3069\u305D\u3063\u3061\u306E\u888B\u3082\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3048\u308B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good idea. Sorry, but could you carry that bag too?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u30FC\u3044\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u3058\u3083\u3001\u884C\u304D\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sure! Shall we go?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3063\u3066\u3001\u307B\u3093\u3063\u3068\u3046\u306B\n\u3000\u3059\u307C\u3089\u306A\u306E\u306D\u2026\u2026\n\u3000\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u89AA\u8FD1\u611F\u3001\u304B\u3082\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Saskia really is quite disorganized... Maybe we\u0027re more alike than I thought.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]